    {
      "id": "summary-takeaways-node",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 540,
      "y": 1100,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "### \ud83d\udca1 Key Canvas Architecture Capabilities Verified\n- **Bidirectional Sync**: Visual canvas edits immediately update PostgreSQL and host `.canvas` files.\n- **Sub-Canvases**: Nested canvas cards function as first-class drill-downs with live node/edge counters.\n- **ReBAC-Enriched Cards**: Paper nodes dynamically resolve publication metadata, abstracts, and read statuses.\n- **Standard Gestures**: Spacebar hand pan, right-click pan, 2-finger scroll, marquee select (`Shift+Drag`), and 20px grid snapping."
    },
    {
